      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk how to explain it but i just feel like i've ruined everything. my parents moved across the world for me to have these chances and now i'm just... failing. i've messed up so bad that i can't even look at them without feeling like a total disgrace. it's like i'm just a stain on everything they worked for.",
